<title>UK: SOCCER-ENGLISH LEAGUE CUP SECOND ROUND DRAW.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ENGLISH LEAGUE CUP SECOND ROUND DRAW.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Draw for the second round of the</p>
<p>English League Cup made on Thursday:</p>
<p>Sheffield Wednesday v Oxford</p>
<p> Fulham		  v Ipswich</p>
<p> Preston		 v Tottenham</p>
<p> Blackpool	     v Chelsea</p>
<p> Southampton	   v Peterborough</p>
<p> Oldham		  v Tranmere</p>
<p> Barnsley		v Gillingham</p>
<p> Bury		    v Crystal Palace</p>
<p> Wimbledon	     v Portsmouth</p>
<p> Middlesbrough	 v Hereford</p>
<p> Nottingham Forest   v Wycombe</p>
<p> Swindon		 v Queens Park Rangers</p>
<p> Brentford	     v Blackburn</p>
<p> Scarborough	   v Leicester</p>
<p> Bristol City	  v Bolton</p>
<p> Lincoln		 v Manchester City</p>
<p> Barnet		  v West Ham</p>
<p> Charlton		v Burnley</p>
<p> Leeds		   v Darlington</p>
<p> Stockport	     v Sheffield United</p>
<p> Everton		 v York</p>
<p> Huddersfield	  v Colchester</p>
<p> Watford		 v Sunderland</p>
<p> Luton		   v Derby</p>
<p> Port Vale	     v Carlisle</p>
<p> Coventry		v Birmingham</p>
<p> Stoke		   v Northampton</p>
<p>Ties to be played over two legs. First leg during week</p>
<p>commencing September 16, Second leg week commencing September</p>
<p>23.</p>
<p>The five teams involved in European club competitions -</p>
<p>Manchester United, Liverpool, Newcastle, Aston Villa and</p>
<p>Arsenal - are exempt from the second round.</p>
</text>
